1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
My island lies o'er the ocean;

2
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:19,000
Like a wreath of flowers upon the sea;

3
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:29,000
With the light of the Maker from far above;

4
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:37,000
Shining with the brilliance of rays of life;

5
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:45,000
Our Father's wondrous creation;

6
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:56,000
Bequeathed to us, our motherland;

7
00:00:56,100 --> 00:01:06,000
I'll never leave my dear home sweet home;

8
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:14,000
God of our forefathers protect and bless forever Marshall Islands.